OL,3,APupil who stabbed teacher in head given
OL,4,Afour-year detention order
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pupil who stabbed a teacher in the
OL,7,Fhead with a kitchen knife after asking
OL,8,Fher to check his homework has been
OL,9,Fsentenced to four-and-a-half years in
OL,10,Fyouth detention.
OL,12,FThe 16-year-old boy followed Vicki
OL,13,FWilliams into her empty classroom at
OL,14,FMilford Haven Comprehensive School,
OL,15,FPembrokeshire, after asking for help
OL,16,Fwith his work on 5 February.
OL,18,FThe teenager pulled a knife from his
OL,19,Fbag and lunged at her, Swansea Crown
OL,20,FCourt previously heard, with Williams
OL,21,Fsaying she feared she would die.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
